# FlowTree — Projetos (boards) — módulo `tasks`

@host = http://localhost:5100/api
@token = COLE_O_TOKEN_AQUI
@projectUuid = COLE_O_UUID_DO_PROJETO
@memberUuid = COLE_O_UUID_DE_UM_USUARIO

### Listar projetos ativos
GET {{host}}/projects
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Listar projetos arquivados
GET {{host}}/projects?archived=1
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Buscar projeto pelo nome
GET {{host}}/projects?search=demo
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Criar projeto (gera as colunas padrão do FlowTree)
POST {{host}}/projects
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "App Mobile",
  "description": "Aplicativo iOS/Android.",
  "color": "#4d6f6c",
  "member_uuids": ["{{memberUuid}}"]
}

### Detalhar projeto (owner, members, columns, sprints)
GET {{host}}/projects/{{projectUuid}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Atualizar projeto
PUT {{host}}/projects/{{projectUuid}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "App Mobile v2",
  "description": "Aplicativo iOS/Android — segunda fase.",
  "color": "#7c8060"
}

### Arquivar projeto
PUT {{host}}/projects/{{projectUuid}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "is_archived": true
}

### Board completo (todas as sprints + backlog)
GET {{host}}/projects/{{projectUuid}}/board?sprint=all
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Board — só o Backlog
GET {{host}}/projects/{{projectUuid}}/board?sprint=backlog
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Board — uma sprint específica
GET {{host}}/projects/{{projectUuid}}/board?sprint=COLE_O_UUID_DA_SPRINT
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Enviar logo (jpg/png/webp/svg, máx. 5 MB)
POST {{host}}/projects/{{projectUuid}}/logo
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----FlowTreeBoundary

------FlowTreeBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="logo"; filename="logo.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./logo.png
------FlowTreeBoundary--

### Remover logo
DELETE {{host}}/projects/{{projectUuid}}/logo
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Excluir projeto
DELETE {{host}}/projects/{{projectUuid}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
